[style name="estilodetodo"]
join "gatito terapeuta" (neutro) 2 [animation="Fade In Out" length="1" wait="true"]
user: Hi, I'm sorry for being late, I got caught up in traffic.
"gatito terapeuta" (paz): That's okay! Traffic's been really bad around here lately.
"gatito terapeuta": Let's start with introductions, my name is gatsby and I will be your therapist from now on! Tell me, what's your name?
set {cat_name} = "Gatsby"
[text_input text="My name is:" var="username"]
"gatito terapeuta" (feliz): That's a pretty name! So, tell me {username}, why did you decide to come here?
user: My memories don't feel quite right. When i try to remember certain things, it feels like something's blocking me.
"gatito terapeuta" (triste): Oh, my. That sounds hard. When did you begin to feel this way?
user: About a month ago. It's like I'm stuck in a room in my mind where all my memories are in picture frames, but they all look... off.
"gatito terapeuta" (neutro): That's an interesting way to put it. Do you want to talk about it?
user: I don't know. Is this even gonna work? I'm so tired all the time...
"gatito terapeuta": Well, we can try and see. The important thing is that we don't lose [color=yellow]hope[/color].
- Hope?
"gatito terapeuta" (neutro): Yeah, that's right. So, tell me more about this mental room of yours...
user: It's... well, it looks exactly like my childhood bedroom. Except there's no windows and all the walls are bare except for the pictures.
leave "gatito terapeuta" [animation="Fade In Out"]
user: I look sad in moments where I know for *sure* I was happy, and everything looks grim.
[end_timeline]
[signal arg="mental_room"]
